# Firebase service-account JSON (FCM admin credentials). Treat like a
# password — anyone with this file can send push to every Construct
# Mobile device. Set FCM_CREDENTIALS_FILE in the deploy env to point at
# this file's runtime location; never commit it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
